    {"symbol": "⚖️", "tooltip": "The split verdict: shield the deliberation, open the record of what was already reported."},
    {"symbol": "🗂️", "tooltip": "Records only protect people if someone can actually reach them — the file drawer no victim can open is a filing cabinet, not accountability."}
  ],
